ion, explore our {spirit-bear}, {bernese-mountain-dog}, and {frog} name collections.\"}}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Conservation Hero Names\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Explore our name generators for \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"32\",{\"href\":\"/animal/african-wild-dog/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"African Wild Dog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"52\",{\"href\":\"/animal/african-golden-wolf/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"African Golden Wolf\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"75\",{\"href\":\"/animal/american-black-bear/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"American Black Bear\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"98\",{\"href\":\"/animal/american-bullfrog/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"American Bullfrog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"123\",{\"href\":\"/animal/antechinus/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Antechinus\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" to find the perfect name for your companion.\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Jane</strong> (Goodall), <strong>Dian</strong> (Fossey), <strong>Steve</strong> (Irwin), <strong>David</strong> (Attenborough), <strong>Rachel</strong> (Carson), <strong>Greta</strong> (Thunberg). For more naming inspiration, explore our {whooping-crane}, {frilled-shark}, and {german-pinscher} name collections.\"}}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Real-World Example: How a Pet Name Sparked Conservation Action\"]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":