"}}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Conservation Hero Names\"]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Explore our name generators for \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"32\",{\"href\":\"/animal/african-wild-dog/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"African Wild Dog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"52\",{\"href\":\"/animal/african-golden-wolf/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"African Golden Wolf\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"75\",{\"href\":\"/animal/american-black-bear/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"American Black Bear\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"98\",{\"href\":\"/animal/american-bullfrog/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"American Bullfrog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"123\",{\"href\":\"/animal/antechinus/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Antechinus\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" to find the perfect name for your companion.\"]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Jane</strong> (Goodall), <strong>Dian</strong> (Fossey), <strong>Steve</strong> (Irwin), <strong>David</strong> (Attenborough), <strong>Rachel</strong> (Carson), <strong>Greta</strong> (Thunberg). For more naming inspiration, explore our {whooping-crane}, {frilled-shark}, and {german-pinscher} name collections.\"}}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Real-World Example: How a Pet Name Sparked Conservation Action\"]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"When Sarah named her rescue dog 'Dhole' — after the endangered Asian wild dog — she had no idea how far the name would travel. Friends asked about it, then family, then strangers at the dog park. Within a year, Sarah had raised over $2,000 for dhole conservation through a birthday fundraiser inspired entirely by her dog's name. 'It started with a name I thought sounded cool,' she says. 'Now I'm genuinely involved in wildlife protection.' This story illustrates the quiet power an animal name can carry. For more naming inspiration, explore our \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"548\",{\"href\":\"/animal/cicada-killer/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Cicada Killer\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"565\",{\"href\":\"/animal/saiga-antelope/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Saiga Antelope\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"587\",{\"href\":\"/animal/scissortail-dartfish/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Scissortail Dartfish\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" name collections.\"]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Endangered Species Names by Category\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"p\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Big Cats: Tiger, Snow Leopard, Cheetah, Amur Leopard, Clouded Leopard, Iberian Lynx. These names carry strength, grace, and wild beauty — perfect for confident, striking pets. For more naming inspiration, explore our \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"217\",{\"href\":\"/animal/pratincole/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Pratincole\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"231\",{\"href\":\"/animal/toad/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Toad\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"243\",{\"href\":\"/animal/yellow-naped-amazon/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Yellow-Naped Amazon\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" name collections.\"]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"p\",\"15\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Marine Life: Blue Whale, Vaquita, Hawksbill Turtle, Dugong, Manatee, Sea Otter. Ocean-inspired names evoke calm, depth, and mystery. Ideal for serene, gentle-natured pets. For more naming inspiration, explore our \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"213\",{\"href\":\"/animal/deathstalker-scorpion/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Deathstalker Scorpion\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"238\",{\"href\":\"/animal/sea-angel/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Sea Angel\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"255\",{\"href\":\"/animal/porcupine/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Porcupine\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" name collections.\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Birds: Kakapo, California Condor, Philippine Eagle, Spoon-billed Sandpiper, Whooping Crane. Avian names feel light, free, and melodic — excellent for small, spirited pets. For more naming inspiration, explore our \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"213\",{\"href\":\"/animal/palm-cockatoo/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Palm Cockatoo\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"230\",{\"href\":\"/animal/rockhopper-penguin/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Rockhopper Penguin\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"256\",{\"href\":\"/animal/deathstalker-scorpion/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Deathstalker Scorpion\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" name collections.\"]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"p\",\"17\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Primates & Mammals: Mountain Gorilla, Orangutan, Red Panda, Saola, Dhole, Black-footed Ferret. These names connect to our closest animal relatives and convey intelligence and warmth. For more naming inspiration, explore our \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"224\",{\"href\":\"/animal/red-handed-tamarin/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Red-Handed Tamarin\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"246\",{\"href\":\"/animal/bicolor-blenny/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Bicolor Blenny\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"268\",{\"href\":\"/animal/sleeper-goby/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Sleeper Goby\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" name collections.\"]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"p\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Explore naming resources for \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"29\",{\"href\":\"/animal/anoa/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Anoa\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"37\",{\"href\":\"/animal/carmine-bee-eater/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Carmine Bee-Eater\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"58\",{\"href\":\"/animal/whites-tree-frog/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"White's Tree Frog\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"78\",{\"href\":\"/animal/flasher-wrasse/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Flasher Wrasse\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"96\",{\"href\":\"/animal/serval/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Serval\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"106\",{\"href\":\"/animal/hognose-snake/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Hognose Snake\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"123\",{\"href\":\"/animal/puma/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Puma\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"131\",{\"href\":\"/animal/regal-horned-lizard/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Regal Horned Lizard\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"154\",{\"href\":\"/animal/boomslang-snake/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Boomslang Snake\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"173\",{\"href\":\"/animal/lovebird/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Lovebird\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and hundreds more animals at BestAnimalNames.com.\"]}]\n36:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Why is naming an endangered species meaningful?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Naming an animal after an endangered species creates a personal connection to conservation. Every time you call your pet's name, you're reminded of the real animals that need protection. It's a small, daily act of awareness that can spark conversations and inspire others to care about wildlife preservation.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are the most popular endangered species names for pets?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Tiger, Panda, Cheetah, and Snow Leopard are consistently popular choices. Koala and Red Panda have surged in recent years. Marine-inspired names like Dolphin, Sea Turtle, and Blue Whale are also widely used. These names work well because they're recognizable, easy to pronounce, and carry positive associations.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can I name my pet after an endangered animal that doesn't match their species?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely. A cat named Panda or a dog named Tiger is both common and charming. There's no rule that names must match the species — in fact, the contrast can be delightful. The name carries meaning regardless of what animal wears it.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Are there regional endangered species names worth considering?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes. Consider naming your pet after a species local to your region — it strengthens your connection to local conservation efforts. For example, a California Condor for a bird, a Florida Panther for a cat, or an Iberian Lynx for Spanish-speaking pet owners. These regional names add a personal, place-based dimension.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How can naming my pet help endangered species awareness?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"When someone asks about your pet's unusual name, you have a natural opportunity to share information about the real endangered animal. 'Her name is Saola — it's one of the rarest mammals on Earth' often leads to meaningful conversations. Over a pet's lifetime, that name can spark hundreds of awareness-raising moments.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are some lesser-known endangered species with beautiful names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Many rare species have lyrical names perfect for pets: Quokka (a smiling marsupial), Saola (the 'Asian unicorn'), Vaquita (the world's rarest marine mammal), Kakapo (a flightless parrot), Dhole (an Asian wild dog), and Pangolin (a scaled mammal). These names are unique, beautiful, and rich with meaning.\"}]]}],\"$L3c\"]}]]}]\n37:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"tiger\",{\"href\":\"/animal/tiger/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐯\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Tiger\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"elephant\",{\"href\":\"/animal/elephant/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\